# T_SCRE: F4 on the location of the filter search, the location list
# answered "-ERR 402" (other sessions are open; the test's answer, as
# the server gives 402 only to a command that needs the system to
# itself): the message on the hint row, then the search's own hints
# again at the next key.
K TAB F4
S BUSY
K TAB
S HINTS
K ESC
